    "title": "WEATHER: Flash flood warning issued for parts of Lyon, Osage, Wabaunsee counties - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chuck Samples and Tagan Trahoon ,\n14 hours ago Heavy rain so far this week and a prospect of additional rainfall has led to several flood alerts for area counties. *Flash flood warning: North Lyon, Osage, southeast Wabaunsee counties until 9:45 pm. Warning follows 1-3 inches of rain already with another 1-3 inches of rainfall possible through the warning. Includes Admire, Allen, Americus, Burlingame, Bushong, Carbondale, Harveyville, Lyndon, Quenemo, Reading and Scranton. Read full article",
